@namespace CommonLibraryP.SecsGemPKG.Component
@rendermode RenderMode.InteractiveServer
@using CommonLibraryP.SecsGemPKG
<DxTreeView @ref="@dxTreeView" Data="@secsTreeNodes" SelectionChanged="NodeSelectionChanged"
            AllowSelectNodes="true"
            AnimationType="LayoutAnimationType.Slide">
    <DataMappings>
        <DxTreeViewDataMapping Text="@nameof(SecsTreeNode.CodeOrValueString)"
                               Children="@nameof(SecsTreeNode.ChildrenNode)" />
    </DataMappings>
</DxTreeView>

@code {
    DxTreeView? dxTreeView { get; set; }
    [Parameter]
    public bool AutoExpand { get; set; } = true;
    [Parameter]
    public SecsTreeNode SecsItem { get; set; } = null!;
    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback<SecsTreeNode> OnNodeSelected { get; set; }

    private List<SecsTreeNode> secsTreeNodes => new List<SecsTreeNode> { SecsItem };

    protected override Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (AutoExpand)
        {
            dxTreeView?.ExpandAll();
        }
        return base.OnAfterRenderAsync(firstRender);
    }

    private async Task NodeSelectionChanged(TreeViewNodeEventArgs e)
    {
        if (e.NodeInfo is not null)
        {
            if (e.NodeInfo.DataItem is SecsTreeNode secsTreeNode)
            {
                await OnNodeSelected.InvokeAsync(secsTreeNode);
            }
        }
    }
}
